    "text": "For a complex number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math>, if all the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are unimodular, then",
